              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliyaani dubbi tana buufate jennaani, Ahabuni woya ufi tarsaase, baafate, ch'arqi naqate. Inni sagalele nyaachu dide, woya ch'arqi sunini bule, fuula yakate, miira hamaate, ufuma dedeeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.27",
