            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini aka Ahabuni na durati ufi diqeese agarte? Waan inni akana taheefi, haga inni jiru amma gaargala itiini ind'ufu; ammo gaafa ilmi isaa hayyu tahu gaargala worra isaatini d'ufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.29",
